issues.body:
In earlier drafts of the document these were removed via implicit acking, but IIUC that wasn't implemented, and this mechanism also doesn't work for acks sent in binding responses.

@juberti proposal: just remove ACKs for Flight N when Flight N+1 is sent (as there's no need to ack old flights)
